  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed IDP Economic Development Support Project (IDP-EDS) is a repeater project that replicates part of the Pilot Reconstruction Project (Cr. 31090/31091-AZ), and its objective, like that of its predecessor, is to help improve the living conditions of IDPs and enhance their economic opportunities and prospects for social integration.</narrative>
  </description>
